OL,3,GNEWSAEx-police officer who raped girl
OL,4,Ain 1970s jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Leicestershire Police officer
OL,7,Fwho raped and sexually abused a teenage
OL,8,Fgirl in the 1970s has been jailed for
OL,9,F10 years.
OL,11,FPolice said Barry Grummet - who worked
OL,12,Ffor the force between September 1970
OL,13,Fand October 1981 - assaulted the
OL,14,Fschoolgirl at her home in
OL,15,FLeicestershire.
OL,17,FLeicestershire Police said the offences
OL,18,Fwere first reported in 2023 and that he
OL,19,Fdenied the allegations during a
OL,20,Fvoluntary interview.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
