OL,3,GNEWSAEx-police officer who raped girl
OL,4,Ain 1970s jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 86-year-old, of Loughborough Road,
OL,7,FHathern, was found guilty of rape and
OL,8,Fthree counts of indecent assault
OL,9,Ffollowing a trial, and was sentenced at
OL,10,FLeicester Crown Court on Friday.
